log host smoke: X11 app frame has client-drawn shadow pixels and native extents
capture opened
assert text cambium-genet-winit-host smoke
assert snap window_frame == app
assert snap app_frame_inset == 16

# Hold this exact headed window open while the native probe reads its X11
# property and compositor-facing geometry.
await-release
wait

click role:button clicked
settle 1
assert event clicks 1
capture changed

resize 560 400
settle 4
capture resized
assert text cambium-genet-winit-host smoke
log host smoke: X11 shadow done
